From ca12a4e932624404c817b8473e6b147367b9c1e7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mstsc-wine <mstsc-wine@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:54:06 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 13/43] advapi32: Implement CredProtectW, CredUnprotectW and
 CredIsProtectedW.

Wine has no logon-session key yet (RtlEncryptMemory is a no-op), so protected
credentials use Windows' "@@D" prefix with an encoding of the secret but no
encryption.

Co-Authored-By: Andrew J. Moore <andrew@forevermoore.net>
---
 dlls/advapi32/advapi32.spec |   6 +-
 dlls/advapi32/cred.c        | 123 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 dlls/advapi32/tests/cred.c  |  49 ++++++++++++++
 dlls/sechost/sechost.spec   |   6 +-
 4 files changed, 178 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

